{"candidateAnswer":"Flute and cello","evidence":"[D15:26 | 3:19 pm on 28 August, 2023] Melanie: Yeah, I play clarinet! Started when I was young and it's been great. Expression of myself and a way to relax.\n[D2:5 | 1:14 pm on 25 May, 2023] Melanie: Yeah, it's tough. So I'm carving out some me-time each day - running, reading, or playing my violin - which refreshes me and helps me stay present for my fam!","itemId":"urn:uuid:6e636744-5b7f-51d7-9ef7-d54942a5478a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:8818e175d852c502c9d5ec276c7a9026a9a87b6404d37139e4bb39d765e457ed","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What instruments does Melanie play?","referenceAnswer":"clarinet and violin","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"8818e175d852c502c9d5ec276c7a9026a9a87b6404d37139e4bb39d765e457ed"}}]}